{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03612",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 8.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Okay, hi, sit anywhere you like. Right, is this your first time with this clinic?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.13,
      "end_seconds": 14.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Mm, first time with this one, yes. A friend recommended it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.97,
      "end_seconds": 19.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Alright, what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.48,
      "end_seconds": 27.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Doctor, it's refusing food. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.38,
      "end_seconds": 30.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.06,
      "end_seconds": 37.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Ever since... since last Tuesday, really. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.92,
      "end_seconds": 42.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.02,
      "end_seconds": 70.58,
      "duration_seconds": 25.56,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. I've also had seen putting a coin-like object in his mouth. About seen putting a coin-like object in his mouth, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. Oh, and a little drooling. Oh, and a mild cough. Had that since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.05,
      "end_seconds": 74.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.56,
      "end_seconds": 82.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Okay, so about a seven out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.23,
      "end_seconds": 86.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Have you had any rash or vomiting blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.01,
      "end_seconds": 93.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I haven't had rash or vomiting blood, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.77,
      "end_seconds": 97.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Have you noticed breathing difficulty or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.15,
      "end_seconds": 101.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.0,
      "end_seconds": 106.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.61,
      "end_seconds": 109.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.56,
      "end_seconds": 121.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.55,
      "end_seconds": 132.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.65,
      "end_seconds": 141.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.27,
      "end_seconds": 143.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Yes, high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.42,
      "end_seconds": 145.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.66,
      "end_seconds": 157.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.84,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for nearly five years. I have an underactive thyroid, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.41,
      "end_seconds": 171.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.54,
      "text": "Right, so high cholesterol and high blood pressure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.42,
      "end_seconds": 182.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke. My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.1,
      "end_seconds": 189.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.16,
      "end_seconds": 204.03,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.38,
      "end_seconds": 208.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.02,
      "end_seconds": 221.56,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "Yes, cat fur. I get wheezing. I was told I'm allergic to diclofenac, but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.22,
      "end_seconds": 231.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.97,
      "end_seconds": 239.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I take something called rami... ramipril, 5 milligrams, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.0,
      "end_seconds": 245.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.97,
      "end_seconds": 256.13,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'd been on thyroxine, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.17,
      "end_seconds": 261.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.14,
      "end_seconds": 274.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.45,
      "end_seconds": 304.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 83 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air, temp 36.7 degrees, blood pressure 111 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.4,
      "end_seconds": 309.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.81,
      "end_seconds": 313.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.96,
      "end_seconds": 316.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.14,
      "end_seconds": 328.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "He is playful, breathing normally and the throat looks normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.91,
      "end_seconds": 334.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.04,
      "end_seconds": 366.22,
      "duration_seconds": 13.18,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is a possible swallowed button battery needing an urgent X-ray despite few symptoms. A swallowed coin is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.08,
      "end_seconds": 370.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.99,
      "end_seconds": 391.04,
      "duration_seconds": 16.05,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible swallowed button battery needing an urgent X-ray despite few symptoms do well once it's treated properly. We should do an urgent chest and abdominal X-ray for possible battery ingestion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 391.85,
      "end_seconds": 396.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "We have a slot Wednesday at 11:30 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.8,
      "end_seconds": 428.85,
      "duration_seconds": 30.05,
      "text": "A button battery can burn the gullet within hours even when a child looks well, so we scan now. The paediatric emergency team would be the right next step, I'll refer you. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.49,
      "end_seconds": 433.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.16,
      "end_seconds": 440.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "I'll want another look straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 441.64,
      "end_seconds": 444.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}